OL,3,GNEWSATeen accused of murder denies
OL,4,Abeing in turf war
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager accused of murdering a
OL,7,F21-year-old in a city centre park has
OL,8,Fdenied he was part of a turf war
OL,9,Fbetween drug dealers.
OL,11,FRadwan Shakur, known to his friends as
OL,12,FRads, died after being stabbed through
OL,13,Fthe heart in Chelmsford's Central Park
OL,14,Fon 12 June.
OL,16,FBlaise Mfinda, 18, of Widford Chase,
OL,17,FChelmsford, and a 17-year-old boy who
OL,18,Fcannot be named for legal reasons, are
OL,19,Fon trial and both deny murder.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
